<%= brief %>

Write the scene you are asked for. Reply with a ```json block first, then the narration as plain prose:

```json
{"title": "...", "location": "...",
 "choices": [{"label": "...", "stat": "strength|agility|constitution|intelligence|wisdom|charisma", "difficulty": 12, "difficulty_reason": "..."}],
 "finale": false, "outcome": null}
```

- location: at most <%= Narrator::LOCATION_WORDS %> words.
- choices: exactly three, on three different stats. label: at most <%= Narrator::LABEL_WORDS %> words. difficulty: <%= Narrator::DIFFICULTY.min %> to <%= Narrator::DIFFICULTY.max %>. difficulty_reason: at most <%= Narrator::REASON_WORDS %> words, shown to the player.
- The narration: at most <%= Narrator::SCENE_WORDS %> words.
- The finale: "choices" is empty, "finale" is true, "outcome" is "victory" or "defeat", and the narration runs at most <%= Narrator::FINALE_WORDS %> words.
